      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dc χMT at 1000 Oe shows 45.85 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K, a minimum of 45.36 cm3 K mol−1 at 30 K, and 49.64 cm3 K mol−1 at 2.0 K; Curie–Weiss fit gives C = 45.81 cm3 K mol−1 and θ = 0.023 K. Magnetization reaches 37.58 μB at 7.0 T and 2.0 K. Zero-field ac data show temperature-dependent χ″ below 7.5 K but no χ″ peaks, so Ueff could not be extracted; applied dc fields 0–3000 Oe at 2.0 K did not suppress QTM. Magnetocaloric −ΔSm = 26.68 J kg−1 K−1 at ΔH = 7 T and 3.0 K.",
